meta {
  name: 14 - Reject Transfer On Owned Order
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/store/orders/{{transferOrderId}}/transfer/request
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{customerToken}}
}

tests {
  test("400 Bad Request (Order already belongs to customer)", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(400);
  });
}

docs {
  # 14 - Reject Transfer On Owned Order

  Kiem thu ranh gioi nghiep vu (Self-Ownership Guard):
  Khach hang co tinh gui yeu cau chuyen giao mot don hang von da thuoc ve chinh tai khoan cua minh.
  Medusa Core validate tai `requestOrderTransferValidationStep` va chan dung voi loi HTTP 400 Bad Request ("Order already belongs to customer").
}
